{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>You chase the dragon. That\u2019s it.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No quests. No map. No clue what you\u2019re doing.<br>Just you, a magical forest, and one smug pink dragon that always stays juuust out of reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heroin Hero is a <strong>satirical first-person fever dream</strong>, inspired by the legendary South Park episode and lovingly expanded into a full, chaotic experience filled with confusion, color, and questionable decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>What to expect:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vibrant forest that gets weirder the deeper you go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dragon that mocks you by merely existing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No hand-holding. No tutorials. No mercy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements you don\u2019t need, but will totally chase anyway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emotions, hallucinations, and a shack you call &quot;home&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And maybe\u2026 just maybe\u2026 you\u2019ll catch him.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643940?t=1744740734","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643940/c678e9f05212e076fe748388beb1debd88c1cba1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744740734","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643940/9f63c377a846154728c90214960f1d8b1e7897e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744740734","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643940/9f63c377a846154728c90214960f1d8b1e7897e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744740734","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game depicts repeated use of hard drugs in a stylized, satirical context. It does not include sexual content or violence but explores addiction and its consequences."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>You chase the dragon. That\u2019s it.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No quests. No map. No clue what you\u2019re doing.<br>Just you, a magical forest, and one smug pink dragon that always stays juuust out of reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heroin Hero is a <strong>satirical first-person fever dream</strong>, inspired by the legendary South Park episode and lovingly expanded into a full, chaotic experience filled with confusion, color, and questionable decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>What to expect:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vibrant forest that gets weirder the deeper you go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dragon that mocks you by merely existing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No hand-holding. No tutorials. No mercy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements you don\u2019t need, but will totally chase anyway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emotions, hallucinations, and a shack you call &quot;home&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And maybe\u2026 just maybe\u2026 you\u2019ll catch him.</p></li></ul>","developers":["JPGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643940/c0aa822b0bae717092651503ec55e0cf9f6d18da/header.jpg?t=1744740734","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124162,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124162/movie480.mp4?t=1744740732","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124162/movie_max.mp4?t=1744740732"},"name"